    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know what being 'real' for myself means anymore. it just feels like there's nothing left under the surface. everything is just empty. if everything is already dead and everything is gone, what's even the point of dragging this around? it's just so much effort to exist when there's nothing to exist for.",
